# Design lane (pointer)

When this workspace is doing **UI, a live-site remake, scroll choreography, or hybrid 2D+WebGL**:

1. Read the **`design-lane`** skill, then the library [DESIGN-RESOURCES.md](https://github.com/syed-hassan7/cursor-agent-stack/blob/master/docs/DESIGN-RESOURCES.md) (or `.cursor/design-refs/library.md` in a product repo).
2. Follow the sequence: Impeccable context → named extreme → lookup → code → real screenshot. Do not start at ui-ux-pro-max or Superdesign.
3. Do not re-open rejected connectors (Relume, Spline-as-hero, Shadcn Studio, …) without new evidence.
4. New machine: [NEW-DEVICE.md](https://github.com/syed-hassan7/cursor-agent-stack/blob/master/docs/NEW-DEVICE.md).

If this is a backend-only change, this rule is inert.
